  <item>
    <title>vlo.49：嫁入豪门指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696f80ebef1cf272a77aadc4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696f80ebef1cf272a77aadc4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Jan 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgBNHn_aM7qcUhjjoUw-NmwrDDMO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>你是否也对“嫁入豪门”的都市传说充满好奇？本期节目，我们将从章泽天、郭晶晶和网红晚晚的三种不同人生路径切入，深扒那些所谓的“贵妇养成指南”背后的真相。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期非正式指南都将带你透过现象看本质。撕掉标签，其实最好的“豪门”入场券，是你自己无可替代的价值。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiKI0WSv917s9hmqE5L74ppI4zNm.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 豪门样本：对比章泽天、晚晚、郭晶晶三种截然不同的“豪门”叙事。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> 章泽天的播客争议</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="891">14:51</a>野路子揭秘：为了偶遇大佬，有人租房也要挤进富人区，甚至给狗买爱马仕</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1897">31:37</a> 富哥避雷：警惕那种开迈巴赫追尾你的“白富美”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2472">41:12</a> 想嫁豪门的核心竞争力</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmy8X6zPVdkSCl8nvyK5Cvzmqp2W.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>☆☆☆ 小红书 ：ponpon哲</span></p><span></span><p><span>☆☆☆ 抖音 ：「无所魏」女士</span></p><span></span><p><span>☆☆☆ 邮箱：137999735@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频播客上线｜关注B站：ponpon哲</span></p>]]></description>
