  <item>
    <title>vlo.48：年会指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69665eb9109824f9e152b3f0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69665eb9109824f9e152b3f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Jan 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgBNHn_aM7qcUhjjoUw-NmwrDDMO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2026年的第一个月，大家期待的年终奖可能还没到手，但一年一度的“职场大考”——年会，已经蓄势待发。面对这场可能包含才艺表演、敬酒文化和社交尴尬的集体活动，你是选择积极融入，还是默默隐身？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们从年会表演的避坑指南，到酒桌上的高情商话术，再到幕后筹备的辛酸泪，全方位拆解了年会的各种套路。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiKI0WSv917s9hmqE5L74ppI4zNm.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 话题开启：从网传年终奖取消的谣言，聊到年会这个躲不掉的职场议题。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">03:13</a> 入职填特长需谨慎！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a> 不想表演？那就主动揽下签到、导演等幕后工作，“两害取其轻”。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a> 酒桌生存学</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 领导敬酒怎么接？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a> 被领导当众夸奖怎么办？教科书式回答：把高帽子摘下来，戴给所有人。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">24:32</a> 敬酒礼仪</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1816">30:16</a> 离场艺术</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2356">39:16</a> 礼物采购一定要留好发票！应对奇葩同事要求退换货的终极绝招。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmy8X6zPVdkSCl8nvyK5Cvzmqp2W.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>☆☆☆ 小红书 ：ponpon哲</span></p><span></span><p><span>☆☆☆ 抖音 ：「无所魏」女士</span></p><span></span><p><span>☆☆☆ 邮箱：137999735@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频播客上线｜关注B站：ponpon哲</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/674081dd35a0ff1612c52283/lvJhy6fOdDbOBhIyCLSxnaXTV2kF.m4a" length="43128582" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkIf34WlFC-6BQdbKIfbUTdYIyPi.png"/>
